## 5. JSON-LD WebPage Schema Generation

Create a valid Schema.org WebPage JSON-LD structure.

Generate:

{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "",
  "url": "",
  "description": "",
  "isPartOf": {},
  "about": {},
  "author": {},
  "publisher": {},
  "datePublished": "",
  "dateModified": ""
}


Ensure:

- Valid Schema.org format
- Correct property usage
- Search engine compatibility
- Clear entity relationships


